    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "VisualWebArena consists of three web environments: Classifieds, Shopping, and Reddit. Each environment has a set of tasks that require agents to process visual and textual information. For example, in the Classifieds environment, an agent might need to <strong>search for a specific product</strong>, <strong>filter results by price</strong>, and <strong>make a purchase</strong>.",
