    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "The results show that <strong>multimodal agents</strong> outperform text-based agents on VisualWebArena tasks. The best-performing agent, GPT-4V, achieves a success rate of 16.4%. However, there is still a significant gap between the performance of state-of-the-art agents and human performance, which is 88.7%.",
